# Task memory under .freeflow/tasks/ is gitignored (it must never be committed), but agents must still find it.
# ripgrep-based search honors this file over .gitignore: records, specs, plans, and handoffs are searchable;
# bulky evidence, scratch copies, and saved sources are not.
!/.freeflow/
!/.freeflow/tasks/
/.freeflow/tasks/*/evidence/
/.freeflow/tasks/*/scratch/
/.freeflow/tasks/*/sources/
